 "summary": "The new files `ExtChartAt/ChartSource.lean`, `Family/Prod.lean`, `Inhomogeneous/Prod.lean` and `Inhomogeneous/OfChart.lean` each have a module docstring that says what they contain and why, and every public definition and main theorem (`prod`, `ofChart`, `inCoordinates_ofChart_tangentHom`, `ofChart_mem_inhomogeneousTerms`, `inChart_chartSource(Centre)`, `ext_tangentHom`, `mem_chartFrame_baseSet`) is documented accurately and without overclaiming. The cross-reference to `mem_extChartAt_chartSourceCentre_source` resolves (`ExtChartAt.lean:224`), and the Cauchy\u2013Riemann sign convention in `Inhomogeneous/Prod.lean` matches the existing `Weak/Invariance.lean`.",
